 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Weddings are nerve wracking, but a list helps. Start the night before, if you wake up early. Write it all down. The time, the order, who needs what. Keep it near your bed. On day, keep it simple. Greet the bride and groom, the bride's parents, the bridesmaids, the groom's parents, the bridesmaids. Give it a try. Once the bride and groom go off, focus on your mother and grandmother. The bridesmaids will thank you in person.",
